<title>FINLAND: FEC 1996 OPERATING PROFIT FIM 314 MLN VS 402 MLN.</title>
<headline>FEC 1996 OPERATING PROFIT FIM 314 MLN VS 402 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish state-owned credit institute Finnish Export Credit (FEC) said in a statement on Monday its 1996 operating profit was 313.8 million markka, down from 402 million in 1995.</p>
<p>&quot;According to preliminary data, Finnish Export Credit's operating profit for 1996 was 313.8 million markka,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>FEC's 1996 balance sheet total was 44.3 billion markka, up from 37.6 billion markka in 1995.</p>
<p>The amount of outstanding loans granted rose 6.8 percent year-on-year in 1996 to 23.2 billion markka, FEC said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
